# cFish.io Client Response System

This file provides guidance for client interactions with these priorities:
1. 4-hour maximum response time to all client inquiries
2. Venue-specific approach tailored to client type
3. Focus on immediate revenue-generating activities

## Core Client Commitment
- All client inquiries receive acknowledgment within 1 hour
- Complete responses delivered within 4 hours maximum
- Every client communication includes relevant portfolio examples
- All client interactions are documented in patterns directory

## Client Task Format
When requesting client tasks, use this format:

```markdown
TASK: [Brief client communication task]
Client Type: [Club|Lounge|Bar|Residential|Other]
Priority: [REVENUE-CRITICAL|REVENUE-HIGH|REVENUE-MEDIUM]
Timeline: [Expected response time]
Success Criteria: [Client response or action]
```

## Documentation Format
Document client interactions with this format:

```markdown
## [Client Name] - [Contact Purpose] (MM-DD-2025)
- Brief summary of communication
- Key information shared with client
- Client feedback received
- Planned next steps
- Response timeline

_Contact Made MM-DD-2025 | Response Expected By: MM-DD-2025_
```

## Pattern Documentation
Document successful client interactions in "patterns" directory:
- What worked with this client type
- Which portfolio examples resonated
- Response times that led to conversion
- Follow-up sequences that were effective 